{"name":"BooleanAnalysis.influence_eq_sum_fourier","v":1,"source_hash":"e5f13ded190780eb","lines":["n : ℕ","i : Fin n","f : BooleanFunc n","⊢ influence i f = ∑ S, if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S ^ 2 else 0","key : ∀ (x : BoolCube n), f x - f (flipBit x i) = 2 * ∑ S, if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x else 0","⊢ ∀ (x : BoolCube n), f x - f (flipBit x i) = 2 * ∑ S, if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x else 0","x : BoolCube n","⊢ f x - f (flipBit x i) = 2 * ∑ S, if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x else 0","⊢ ∑ x_1, (fourierCoeff f x_1 * chiS x_1 x - fourierCoeff f x_1 * chiS x_1 (flipBit x i)) =","    2 * ∑ S, if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x else 0","⊢ ∑ x_1, fourierCoeff f x_1 * (chiS x_1 x - if i ∈ x_1 then -chiS x_1 x else chiS x_1 x) =","    ∑ S, if i ∈ S then 2 * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x) else 0","⊢ (∑ S, if i ∈ S then 2 * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x) else 0) =","⊢ ∀ x_1 ∈ Finset.univ,","    fourierCoeff f x_1 * (chiS x_1 x - if i ∈ x_1 then -chiS x_1 x else chiS x_1 x) =","      if i ∈ x_1 then 2 * (fourierCoeff f x_1 * chiS x_1 x) else 0","S : Finset (Fin n)","a✝ : S ∈ Finset.univ","⊢ fourierCoeff f S * (chiS S x - if i ∈ S then -chiS S x else chiS S x) =","    if i ∈ S then 2 * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x) else 0","⊢ S ∈ Finset.univ →","    fourierCoeff f S * (chiS S x - if i ∈ S then -chiS S x else chiS S x) =","      if i ∈ S then 2 * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x) else 0","case pos","hiS : i ∈ S","case neg","hiS : i ∉ S","⊢ fourierCoeff f S * (chiS S x + chiS S x) = fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x + fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x","    ∑ i_1, 2 * if i ∈ i_1 then fourierCoeff f i_1 * chiS i_1 x else 0","    (if i ∈ x_1 then 2 * (fourierCoeff f x_1 * chiS x_1 x) else 0) =","      2 * if i ∈ x_1 then fourierCoeff f x_1 * chiS x_1 x else 0","⊢ (if i ∈ S then 2 * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x) else 0) = 2 * if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x else 0","    (if i ∈ S then 2 * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x) else 0) = 2 * if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x else 0","h✝ : i ∈ S","⊢ 2 * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x) = 2 * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x)","h✝ : i ∉ S","⊢ 0 = 2 * 0","⊢ 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, (f x - f (flipBit x i)) ^ 2 / 4 = ∑ S, if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S ^ 2 else 0","⊢ 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, (2 * ∑ S, if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x else 0) ^ 2 / 4 =","    ∑ S, if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S ^ 2 else 0","⊢ 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, (∑ S, if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x else 0) ^ 2 =","⊢ (2 * ∑ S, if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x else 0) ^ 2 / 4 =","    (∑ S, if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x else 0) ^ 2","⊢ (innerProduct (fun x => ∑ S, (if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S else 0) * chiS S x) fun x =>","      ∑ S, (if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S else 0) * chiS S x) =","    innerProduct (fun x => ∑ S, (if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S else 0) * chiS S x) fun x =>","      ∑ S, (if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S else 0) * chiS S x","⊢ (2⁻¹ ^ n *","      ∑ x,","        (∑ S, if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x else 0) *","          ∑ S, if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x else 0) =","    2⁻¹ ^ n *","        (∑ S, (if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S else 0) * chiS S x) *","          ∑ S, (if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S else 0) * chiS S x","case e_a","⊢ (∑ x,","      (∑ S, if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x else 0) * ∑ S, if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x else 0) =","    ∑ x,","      (∑ S, (if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S else 0) * chiS S x) *","        ∑ S, (if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S else 0) * chiS S x","⊢ ∀ x ∈ Finset.univ,","    ((∑ S, if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x else 0) * ∑ S, if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x else 0) =","a✝ : x ∈ Finset.univ","⊢ ((∑ S, if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x else 0) * ∑ S, if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x else 0) =","    (∑ S, (if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S else 0) * chiS S x) * ∑ S, (if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S else 0) * chiS S x","⊢ x ∈ Finset.univ →","case e_a.e_a","⊢ (∑ S, if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x else 0) = ∑ S, (if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S else 0) * chiS S x","    (if i ∈ x_1 then fourierCoeff f x_1 * chiS x_1 x else 0) = (if i ∈ x_1 then fourierCoeff f x_1 else 0) * chiS x_1 x","a✝¹ : x ∈ Finset.univ","⊢ (if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x else 0) = (if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S else 0) * chiS S x","    (if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x else 0) = (if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S else 0) * chiS S x","⊢ ∑ S, fourierCoeff (fun x => ∑ S, (if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S else 0) * chiS S x) S ^ 2 =","    fourierCoeff (fun x => ∑ S, (if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S else 0) * chiS S x) x ^ 2 =","      if i ∈ x then fourierCoeff f x ^ 2 else 0","⊢ fourierCoeff (fun x => ∑ S, (if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S else 0) * chiS S x) S ^ 2 =","    if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S ^ 2 else 0","    fourierCoeff (fun x => ∑ S, (if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S else 0) * chiS S x) S ^ 2 =","      if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S ^ 2 else 0","hfc :","  fourierCoeff (fun x => ∑ T, (if i ∈ T then fourierCoeff f T else 0) * chiS T x) S =","    if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S else 0","⊢ fourierCoeff (fun x => ∑ T, (if i ∈ T then fourierCoeff f T else 0) * chiS T x) S =","⊢ 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, (∑ x_1, (if i ∈ x_1 then 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, f x * chiS x_1 x else 0) * chiS x_1 x) * chiS S x =","    if i ∈ S then 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, f x * chiS S x else 0","⊢ ∑ T, (if i ∈ T then 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS T y else 0) * (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, chiS T x * chiS S x) =","⊢ 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, (∑ T, (if i ∈ T then 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS T y else 0) * chiS T x) * chiS S x =","    ∑ T, (if i ∈ T then 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS T y else 0) * (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, chiS T x * chiS S x)","⊢ ∑ x, ∑ T, (if i ∈ T then 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS T y else 0) * (2⁻¹ ^ n * (chiS T x * chiS S x)) =","    ∑ x, ∑ T, (if i ∈ T then 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS T y else 0) * (2⁻¹ ^ n * (chiS T x * chiS S x))","⊢ ∑ i_1, 2⁻¹ ^ n * ((∑ T, (if i ∈ T then 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS T y else 0) * chiS T i_1) * chiS S i_1) =","    2⁻¹ ^ n * ((∑ T, (if i ∈ T then 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS T y else 0) * chiS T x) * chiS S x) =","      ∑ T, (if i ∈ T then 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS T y else 0) * (2⁻¹ ^ n * (chiS T x * chiS S x))","a✝¹ : S ∈ Finset.univ","⊢ 2⁻¹ ^ n * ((∑ T, (if i ∈ T then 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS T y else 0) * chiS T x) * chiS S x) =","    ∑ T, (if i ∈ T then 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS T y else 0) * (2⁻¹ ^ n * (chiS T x * chiS S x))","⊢ ∑ i_1, 2⁻¹ ^ n * ((if i ∈ i_1 then 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS i_1 y else 0) * chiS i_1 x * chiS S x) =","    2⁻¹ ^ n * ((if i ∈ x_1 then 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS x_1 y else 0) * chiS x_1 x * chiS S x) =","      (if i ∈ x_1 then 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS x_1 y else 0) * (2⁻¹ ^ n * (chiS x_1 x * chiS S x))","a✝² : S ∈ Finset.univ","T : Finset (Fin n)","a✝ : T ∈ Finset.univ","⊢ 2⁻¹ ^ n * ((if i ∈ T then 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS T y else 0) * chiS T x * chiS S x) =","    (if i ∈ T then 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS T y else 0) * (2⁻¹ ^ n * (chiS T x * chiS S x))","⊢ T ∈ Finset.univ →","    2⁻¹ ^ n * ((if i ∈ T then 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS T y else 0) * chiS T x * chiS S x) =","      (if i ∈ T then 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS T y else 0) * (2⁻¹ ^ n * (chiS T x * chiS S x))","⊢ ∑ y, ∑ x, (if i ∈ y then 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y_1, f y_1 * chiS y y_1 else 0) * (2⁻¹ ^ n * (chiS y x * chiS S x)) =","    ∑ x_1, (if i ∈ x then 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS x y else 0) * (2⁻¹ ^ n * (chiS x x_1 * chiS S x_1)) =","      (if i ∈ x then 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS x y else 0) * (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x_1, chiS x x_1 * chiS S x_1)","⊢ ∑ x, (if i ∈ T then 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS T y else 0) * (2⁻¹ ^ n * (chiS T x * chiS S x)) =","    (if i ∈ T then 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS T y else 0) * (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, chiS T x * chiS S x)","    ∑ x, (if i ∈ T then 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS T y else 0) * (2⁻¹ ^ n * (chiS T x * chiS S x)) =","      (if i ∈ T then 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS T y else 0) * (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, chiS T x * chiS S x)","⊢ (∑ x, (if i ∈ x then 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS x y else 0) * if x = S then 1 else 0) =","⊢ 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, chiS T x * chiS S x = if T = S then 1 else 0","⊢ innerProduct (chiS T) (chiS S) = if T = S then 1 else 0","⊢ 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, chiS T x * chiS S x = innerProduct (chiS T) (chiS S)","⊢ (if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S else 0) ^ 2 = if i ∈ S then fourierCoeff f S ^ 2 else 0"],"goals":[[0,1,2,3],[0,1,2,4,3],[0,1,2,5],[0,1,2,6,7],[0,1,2,6,8,9],[0,1,2,6,10,9],[0,1,2,6,10,11],[0,1,2,6,12,9],[0,1,2,6,13,14,15],[0,1,2,6,16,17,18,19],[0,1,2,6,16,20,21,22],[23,0,1,2,6,16,17,24,18,19],[25,0,1,2,6,16,17,26,18,19],[23,0,1,2,6,16,17,24,27],[0,1,2,6,12,28],[0,1,2,6,13,29,30],[0,1,2,6,16,17,31],[0,1,2,6,16,20,32],[23,0,1,2,6,16,17,33,34],[25,0,1,2,6,16,17,35,36],[0,1,2,4,37],[0,1,2,4,38,39],[0,1,2,4,40,39],[0,1,2,4,6,41,42],[0,1,2,4,43,44,39],[0,1,2,4,40,45,46],[0,1,2,4,47,48,49,50,51,48,52,53],[54,0,1,2,4,55,56,57,58,59],[54,0,1,2,4,60,61,58,59],[54,0,1,2,4,6,62,63,64],[54,0,1,2,4,6,65,61,58,59],[66,0,1,2,4,6,62,67],[66,0,1,2,4,6,62,13,68],[66,0,1,2,4,6,69,16,17,70],[66,0,1,2,4,6,62,16,20,71],[23,0,1,2,4,6,69,16,17,24,70],[25,0,1,2,4,6,69,16,17,26,70],[0,1,2,4,72,39],[0,1,2,4,60,73,74],[0,1,2,4,16,17,75,76],[0,1,2,4,16,20,77,78],[0,1,2,4,16,17,79,80,81,75,76],[0,1,2,4,16,17,82,81],[0,1,2,4,16,17,83,84],[0,1,2,4,16,17,85,84],[0,1,2,4,16,17,86,87],[0,1,2,4,16,17,88,87],[0,1,2,4,16,17,86,89],[0,1,2,4,16,17,90,89],[0,1,2,4,16,17,60,91,92],[0,1,2,4,16,93,6,62,94,95],[0,1,2,4,16,17,6,65,91,92],[0,1,2,4,16,93,6,62,96,95],[0,1,2,4,16,93,6,62,13,97,98],[0,1,2,4,16,99,6,69,100,101,102,103],[0,1,2,4,16,93,6,62,100,104,105,106],[0,1,2,4,16,17,107,87],[0,1,2,4,16,17,60,108,109],[0,1,2,4,16,93,100,101,110,111],[0,1,2,4,16,17,100,104,112,113],[0,1,2,4,16,17,114,84],[0,1,2,4,16,17,100,115],[0,1,2,4,16,17,100,116],[0,1,2,4,16,17,100,117],[0,1,2,4,16,17,79,80,81,118],[23,0,1,2,4,16,17,79,80,81,24,118],[25,0,1,2,4,16,17,79,80,81,26,118]],"steps":[{"line":10,"col":2,"end_line":27,"end_col":27,"tactic":"have key :\n  ∀ x : BoolCube n,\n    f x -